WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 6.1 · MEAL: Monitoring, Evaluation, Accountability & Learning
MEAL principles and a proportionate system

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
MEAL tells you whether you are doing what you said, and what to change.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Link every piece of data to a decision.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Listen to the people your work affects.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep it small enough to actually use.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Imara tracks attendance, confidence and subject choices to decide which schools stay and how clubs change.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your MEAL purpose and the decisions it informs.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
